Subject: [PATCH] cosmetics: Draw Incari cosmetics on players


diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/renderer/entity/player/AvatarRenderer.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/renderer/entity/player/AvatarRenderer.java
index 1fd159147ffcf439c2fe034e32f5c9ce24fd4bd3..40f06650667e528b073ce26a47bda9dd382bc634 100644
